OL,3,GNEWSADid a Scottish film 'beat
OL,4,AHollywood to the punch' as the first
OL,5,Aever talkie?
OL,6,
OL,7,F"Wait a minute. You ain't heard nothing
OL,8,Fyet."
OL,10,FThat promise, spoken by Al Jolson in
OL,11,Fthe 1927 film The Jazz Singer, made
OL,12,Fmovie history.
OL,14,FThe first recorded dialogue on film,
OL,15,FJolson's eight well-chosen words marked
OL,16,Fthe birth of the "talkies", delivered
OL,17,Fby one of the biggest stars on Earth.
OL,23,APub: 06-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
