OL,3,GNEWSADid a Scottish film 'beat
OL,4,AHollywood to the punch' as the first
OL,5,Aever talkie?
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe moment has long been celebrated in
OL,8,Fpopular culture - most memorably in the
OL,9,F1952 film Singin' in the Rain - and
OL,10,Fthere are plans for a variety of events
OL,11,Fto mark the centenary next year.
